{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-11", "prepared_on": "2026-11-11", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-11</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic sets IPO price range of $70 to $78 per share, implying a $1.404 trillion valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 訂定 IPO 價格區間為每股 70 至 78 美元，隱含估值達 1.404 兆美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic could be worth $1.404 trillion on a fully diluted basis if its shares list at the top of the range. The IPO is expected to be one of the largest ever.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">若以區間上限掛牌，以完全稀釋計算，Anthropic 市值將達 1.404 兆美元，這場 IPO 可能是史上規模最大的之一。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/anthropic-sets-ipo-price-range-of-70-to-78-per-share-to-reach-an-implied-valuation-of-1-404-trillion/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Google releases Gemini 4 Carbon with agent \"swarm\" feature<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出 Gemini 4 Carbon，新增代理「群集」功能</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon is now open to the general public, two weeks after a limited release to cybersecurity defenders. Google calls it its strongest model yet.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon 在兩週前先開放給資安防禦人員後，現已向一般大眾推出。Google 稱它是目前最強的模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1030787/google-gemini-4-carbon-public-rollout\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic unveils Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2: 30% faster, 20% cheaper<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 公布 Claude Fable、Mythos 5.2，效能提高 30%、降價 20%</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new flagship models improve coding, reasoning and vision over 5.1. They also add a fast mode that speeds up token generation by up to 2.5x.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新旗艦模型在程式撰寫、推理與視覺能力上都優於 5.1 版，並新增快速模式，token 生成速度最高可提升 2.5 倍。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180406\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Claude adds spreadsheets and collaborative whiteboards, and can operate third-party apps<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 新增試算表與協作白板，還能直接操作第三方 App</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic introduced Claude Sheets and Claude Whiteboards, and upgraded Interactive Connectors. Users can open and operate third-party apps inside Claude.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Sheets 與 Claude Whiteboards，並升級互動式連接器，讓使用者直接在 Claude 內開啟並操作第三方應用程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180408\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Jensen Huang's troubles leave the AI industry reeling<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳的風波讓 AI 產業震動</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's CEO holds huge sway over AI through his chips and checkbook. An affair with a suspected Chinese spy may put that influence at risk.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 執行長憑藉晶片與資金，在 AI 界舉足輕重。他與一名疑似中國間諜的婚外情，可能讓這份影響力面臨風險。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/jensen-huangs-troubles-leaves-the-ai-industry-reeling/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI, Anthropic face new oversight as New York's AI safety law takes effect<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">紐約 AI 安全法生效，OpenAI、Anthropic 面臨新監管</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Major AI developers must register, disclose safety practices and report critical incidents, or face fines.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">主要 AI 開發商必須登記、揭露安全作法並通報重大事件，否則將面臨罰款。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/openai-anthropic-face-new-oversight-as-new-yorks-ai-safety-law-takes-effect/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Introducing AlphaProof Code: a breakthrough in verifying complex software at depth<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AlphaProof Code 問世：深度驗證複雜軟體的突破</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AlphaProof Code agents wrote three million lines of Lean proofs to verify the core encryption of Signal.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AlphaProof Code 代理撰寫了三百萬行 Lean 證明，用來驗證 Signal 的核心加密。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Microsoft warns that an Outlook zero-day is already being exploited<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟警告 Outlook 零時差漏洞已遭到利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Among the 1,000+ flaws patched in November's Patch Tuesday, Microsoft has detected active exploitation of one Outlook bug. It urges users to patch quickly.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟 11 月例行更新修補逾 1,000 個漏洞，其中一個 Outlook 漏洞已偵測到被利用，呼籲用戶儘速安裝修補程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180405\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Fireworks AI breach spills into Notion, exposing some AI conversation records<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Fireworks AI 遭駭波及 Notion，部分 AI 對話紀錄遭未授權存取</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The AI infrastructure provider's breach let attackers reach some Notion AI conversation records. Notion says about 1% of workspaces are affected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這家 AI 基礎設施業者遭駭，使部分 Notion AI 對話紀錄被未授權存取。Notion 表示約 1% 的工作空間受影響。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180407\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Adobe is going all in on agentic AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Adobe 全面押注代理式 AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At Adobe Max, the company pitched chatbots and AI agents as design assistants that can automate repetitive creative workflows.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在 Adobe Max 大會上，Adobe 主打聊天機器人與 AI 代理可作為設計助理，自動處理重複性的創作流程。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1030593/adobe-max-ai-agents-mcp-firefly-assistant-updates\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}